{"name": "execute_code", "arguments": {"action": "execute", "code": "var u=UnityEngine.Object.FindFirstObjectByType<CayTheGioi.Presentation.UpgradePanelView>();\nreturn System.Linq.Enumerable.ToArray(System.Linq.Enumerable.Select(u.Panel.GetComponentsInChildren<UnityEngine.UI.Text>(true),t=>new {name=t.name,text=t.text,font=t.fontSize,rect=((UnityEngine.RectTransform)t.transform).rect.ToString(),anchor=((UnityEngine.RectTransform)t.transform).anchorMin.ToString()+((UnityEngine.RectTransform)t.transform).anchorMax.ToString(),color=t.color.ToString(),parent=t.transform.parent.name,align=t.alignment.ToString(),height=t.preferredHeight}));"}}